WEBVTT

00:08:59.956 --> 00:09:02.676
which looks like the sex you enjoy alone.

00:09:05.276 --> 00:09:08.556
So, what are we to do?

00:09:09.076 --> 00:09:10.716
Stop faking it.

00:09:11.796 --> 00:09:13.436
Yes, I know you've all done it.

00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:16.116
And you're so, so good at it.

00:09:16.156 --> 00:09:17.156
(Laughter)

00:09:17.236 --> 00:09:20.076
I know it comes from a place
of not feeling normal

00:09:20.116 --> 00:09:21.796
or wanting to communicate something

00:09:21.836 --> 00:09:24.716
or trying to protect
someone else's feelings.

00:09:25.516 --> 00:09:29.356
But all faking does
is strengthen this patriarchal script

00:09:29.396 --> 00:09:33.116
and means your needs
are less likely to be met over time.